        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/6a1aacb412f8d0f3f569c8afd5f0bb49.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/6a1aacb412f8d0f3f569c8afd5f0bb49.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is a cute little precision platformer with puzzle elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift and toss crates to traverse over spike pits and reach higher ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh down buttons to create platforms and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass-through Blocks will become solid when tripped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself and make tight jumps! You got this &lt;3 (:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/e65f61a8bc704510956b2343c770282d.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/e65f61a8bc704510956b2343c770282d.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve more than 36 puzzles across 5 worlds, each puzzle hides a secret musical note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique character with a choice of color palette.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how fast you can speedrun each stage and compete against the local high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fastest runs for each stage are recorded as replays, race against your ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing on a Touch Screen device? Touch Controls are available in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/5f1fbef09f24fd89bfd41b1f9b5b0fb4.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/5f1fbef09f24fd89bfd41b1f9b5b0fb4.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=316 /></span>Do you want to feel Complete? Unlock 32 Unique Trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/931eb432859c417c45593841b2f988fd.avif?t=1773756369\" width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All inputs and controls can be set to any keyboard key or game-pad action you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having trouble focusing on puzzle elements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dim or remove the background details to focus on each puzzle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/1372afeac0a87545dd70991be527ea70.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/1372afeac0a87545dd70991be527ea70.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is Open Source, and made with Godot Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate was first released on September 5th, 2021.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/60ca9e8a614e56fe4bed847c39de2242.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/60ca9e8a614e56fe4bed847c39de2242.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View Tiny Crate on GitHub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/556670034209307695a0438c77bc498f.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/556670034209307695a0438c77bc498f.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=508 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/6a1aacb412f8d0f3f569c8afd5f0bb49.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/6a1aacb412f8d0f3f569c8afd5f0bb49.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is a cute little precision platformer with puzzle elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift and toss crates to traverse over spike pits and reach higher ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh down buttons to create platforms and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass-through Blocks will become solid when tripped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself and make tight jumps! You got this &lt;3 (:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/e65f61a8bc704510956b2343c770282d.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/e65f61a8bc704510956b2343c770282d.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve more than 36 puzzles across 5 worlds, each puzzle hides a secret musical note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique character with a choice of color palette.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how fast you can speedrun each stage and compete against the local high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fastest runs for each stage are recorded as replays, race against your ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing on a Touch Screen device? Touch Controls are available in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/5f1fbef09f24fd89bfd41b1f9b5b0fb4.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/5f1fbef09f24fd89bfd41b1f9b5b0fb4.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=316 /></span>Do you want to feel Complete? Unlock 32 Unique Trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/931eb432859c417c45593841b2f988fd.avif?t=1773756369\" width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All inputs and controls can be set to any keyboard key or game-pad action you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having trouble focusing on puzzle elements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dim or remove the background details to focus on each puzzle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/1372afeac0a87545dd70991be527ea70.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/1372afeac0a87545dd70991be527ea70.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is Open Source, and made with Godot Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate was first released on September 5th, 2021.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/60ca9e8a614e56fe4bed847c39de2242.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/60ca9e8a614e56fe4bed847c39de2242.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View Tiny Crate on GitHub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras/556670034209307695a0438c77bc498f.avif?t=1773756369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733440/extras_big/556670034209307695a0438c77bc498f.avif?t=1773756369 width=1560 height=508 /></span></p>",
